ect, and maintain the telemetry.\n\nTroubleshooting and validation: When the expected data is missing or misleading, check instrumentation, endpoint availability, network access, collector configuration, target health, timestamps, labels, and storage or query behavior. Separate a genuine absence of activity from a collection failure. Compare source-side output with backend data and dashboards. Record the evidence, correct the underlying issue, and verify that the telemetry returns to the expected state."
